From 82580100791e5e77a3fa184477e2f487ba47afd5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 12:42:29 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD vim-style visual selections so terminal panes can
 yank text

Command mode can enter character, line, or block visual selection in the focused pane. The UI tracks the visual range, renders it in reverse video, and records yanked text while terminal byte parsing keeps arrow escape sequences inside visual mode.
